  "description_html": "Skull diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unktaheela\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Unktaheela\">Unktaheela specta</a></i>, primarily based on the holotype specimen <b>UCM 35059</b>. Dotted lines indicate poorly defined sutures or missing bone. Scale bar=10 cm.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cretres.2023.105812\">\"A new genus of small polycotylid plesiosaur from the Upper Cretaceous of the Western Interior Seaway and a clarification of the genus <i>Dolichorhynchops</i>\"</a></li></ul>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r380316416\">.mw-parser-output .restwocol-container{margin-bottom:1.125em}.mw-parser-output .restwocol-main{margin-right:2.8075em}@media screen and (max-width:999px){.mw-parser-output .restwocol-container{display:inline-block}.mw-parser-output .restwocol-main{margin-right:0!important}}@media screen and (min-width:1000px){.mw-parser-output .restwocol-container{display:flex}.mw-parser-output .restwocol-main{flex:3}.mw-parser-output .restwocol-additional{flex:2}}</style><div class=\"restwocol-container\">\n<div class=\"restwocol-main\">\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FF8200\" title=\"#FF8200\"> </b> Premaxilla <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FF9A9C\" title=\"#FF9A9C\"> </b> Maxilla <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FF82FF\" title=\"#FF82FF\"> </b> Frontal <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#AB7197\" title=\"#AB7197\"> </b> Supraorbital ledge <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#84FF00\" title=\"#84FF00\"> </b> Prefrontal <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#9CFF9C\" title=\"#9CFF9C\"> </b> Jugal <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FF0000\" title=\"#FF0000\"> </b> Scleral ring <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#0000FF\" title=\"#0000FF\"> </b> Postorbital <br> \n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#DCFFDC\" title=\"#DCFFDC\"> </b> Parietal <br>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"restwocol-additional\">\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8DA08C\" title=\"#8DA08C\"> </b> Supraorbital ridge <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFBC\" title=\"#FFFFBC\"> </b> Squamosal <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#840084\" title=\"#840084\"> </b> Quadrate <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#84FFFF\" title=\"#84FFFF\"> </b> Epipterygoid <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#9C9AFF\" title=\"#9C9AFF\"> </b> Dentary <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#00FF00\" title=\"#00FF00\"> </b> Angular <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FF0084\" title=\"#FF0084\"> </b> Surrangular <br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7